From f67cb46b46f8460159d16662a78a0c49dd034608 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:39:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Show battery information in the battery settings

Add a Battery information section with the battery's health, charge
cycles, full charge and design capacity, temperature and voltage, read
from the battery's power supply node. Health is the full charge
capacity against the design capacity. A line only shows when its node
can be read.

Change-Id: I8ac60e6f5515b854980c7c3d3c64800c7d135922
---
 res/values/battery_info_strings.xml           | 18 ++++
 res/xml/power_usage_summary.xml               | 40 ++++++++
 .../BatteryInfoPreferenceController.java      | 92 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 150 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 res/values/battery_info_strings.xml
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/fuelgauge/BatteryInfoPreferenceController.java

diff --git a/res/values/battery_info_strings.xml b/res/values/battery_info_strings.xml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..558b3d0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/res/values/battery_info_strings.xml
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
